WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.420
Well, the administration will abide by the ruling

00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:05.980
insofar as it affects the covered parties.

00:00:06.620 --> 00:00:08.020
But there are also many other options

00:00:08.020 --> 00:00:10.660
the President has to deploy federal resources

00:00:10.660 --> 00:00:13.880
and assets under the U.S. military to Portland.

00:00:13.880 --> 00:00:17.120
But I was making the point that under federal law,

00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:20.100
Section Title 10 of the U.S. Code,

00:00:20.799 --> 00:00:21.959
the President has the authority,

00:00:21.959 --> 00:00:24.900
anytime he believes federal resources are insufficient,

00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:26.260
to federalize the National Guard

00:00:26.260 --> 00:00:29.900
to carry out a mission necessary for public safety.

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:31.840
So it's important to understand that in Portland,

00:00:31.840 --> 00:00:33.740
ICE officers have been subjected

00:00:33.740 --> 00:00:36.480
to over 100 nights of terrorist assault,

00:00:36.480 --> 00:00:39.020
doxing, murder threats, violent attack,

00:00:39.020 --> 00:00:41.080
and every other means imaginable

00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:43.459
to try to overturn the results of the last election

00:00:43.459 --> 00:00:44.959
through violence.

00:00:44.959 --> 00:00:46.279
The most important point I want to make today

00:00:46.279 --> 00:00:50.299
is that the number one and two items in the GOP platform

00:00:50.299 --> 00:00:53.320
in 2024 were to turn back the border invasion

00:00:53.320 --> 00:00:55.020
and carry out the largest deportation program

00:00:55.020 --> 00:00:56.360
in American history.

00:00:56.360 --> 00:00:58.340
Since Inauguration Day,

00:00:58.340 --> 00:01:00.139
there's been an orchestrated campaign

00:01:00.139 --> 00:01:02.980
of terrorism and violence against ICE officers.

00:01:02.980 --> 00:01:05.279
Of course, we saw the recent sniper attack

00:01:05.279 --> 00:01:06.419
against ICE officers.

00:01:06.419 --> 00:01:08.360
They're publishing their families' photos online,

00:01:08.360 --> 00:01:09.260
they're threatening them with murder,

00:01:09.260 --> 00:01:10.279
they're threatening them with death,

00:01:10.279 --> 00:01:11.580
and they're physically attacking them

00:01:11.580 --> 00:01:13.660
in the street each and every day.

00:01:13.660 --> 00:01:16.459
And yet, shamefully, the mayor and governor

00:01:16.459 --> 00:01:19.699
in Portland and Oregon have refused to render aid,

00:01:19.699 --> 00:01:23.239
leaving ICE officers to street fight every single night

00:01:23.239 --> 00:01:25.040
against these terrorists.

00:01:25.040 --> 00:01:27.279
You make the claim of terrorist assaults

00:01:27.279 --> 00:01:29.779
and violence attack over 100 nights,

00:01:29.779 --> 00:01:32.739
and yet the judge overseeing this case

00:01:32.739 --> 00:01:35.320
says that that's untethered from reality,

00:01:35.320 --> 00:01:37.120
and local officials on the ground

00:01:37.120 --> 00:01:38.919
say that Trump's assertion of what's happening

00:01:38.919 --> 00:01:41.260
is in Portland, that it's war-ravaged

00:01:41.260 --> 00:01:43.820
and burning to the ground is far from true.

00:01:43.820 --> 00:01:46.000
I looked at the police data,

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:49.559
and police have made something like 70 total arrests

00:01:49.559 --> 00:01:51.699
since June, and there are no reports

00:01:51.699 --> 00:01:53.839
of buildings being burned to the ground.

00:01:53.839 --> 00:01:57.040
The White House cited a guillotine being rolled out

00:01:57.040 --> 00:01:59.699
as a public display of rebellion,

00:01:59.699 --> 00:02:02.180
but there isn't actually a threat

00:02:02.180 --> 00:02:05.019
that these demonstrators are gonna overthrow the government.

00:02:05.019 --> 00:02:07.440
Are you concerned that that response

00:02:07.440 --> 00:02:08.880
weakens your legal argument?

